Package: fmrigds
Type: Package
Title: Group Data Sets for fMRI
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("GDS", "Maintainer", email = "maintainer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
)
Description: Implements the Group Data Set (GDS) blueprint and technical specification
    for representing first-level fMRI outputs in a space-aware, statistically principled,
    and lazy-evaluated R package. The package scaffolding is a starting point for the
    implementation defined in TECHNICAL_SPECIFICATION.md.
